      "id": "claim_c149d46b5d2146a7b6bce43f06acc546",
      "statement": "First-time setup runs make setup = infra + generate + migrate + seed: docker compose up -d --wait for db/redis/adminer via docker-compose.dev.yml, then inside backend/ drizzle-kit generate, drizzle-kit migrate, and npx tsx src/seed.ts, printing the app URLs and the admin/admin123 login. Daily dev runs make dev, which brings up the same compose stack, waits for PostgreSQL on :5440, re-runs best-effort generate + migrate, then runs tsx watch (backend :3090) and vite --port 7173 as one process group; make stop pkills the tsx/vite processes (db stays up), make down stops all compose services, and make clean also removes the database volume.",
