      "id": "claim_0caa789c7c3f402ebc8829da6a92477e",
      "statement": "Database workflow from backend/: pnpm db:generate (drizzle-kit generate diffs src/db/schema.ts into numbered SQL files under backend/drizzle/), pnpm db:migrate (apply pending migrations), and pnpm db:studio (Drizzle Studio GUI); drizzle.config.ts defaults DATABASE_URL to localhost:5440/tingting. Production migrations are applied out-of-band by make prod-migrate, which iterates backend/drizzle/*.sql while excluding *.revert.sql dev-rollback files and applies each with psql --single-transaction inside the production postgres container before restarting the backend; make prod-migrate-file FILE=… applies a single file.",
