      "id": "claim_efc21e20faa940e6ab1bc4371feab45e",
      "statement": "Auth session state lives in Redis: login issues a JWT with a random jti, logout blacklists blacklist:<jti> until token expiry, and authMiddleware rejects any token whose jti is blacklisted. The blacklist check fails closed — when Redis is unreachable tokens are rejected — so Redis must be running for auth, and clearing it logs every user out.",
